&lt;p&gt;Key responsibilities include payroll inputs, benefits enrolment and cancellations, reporting and reconciliations, administration of meal vouchers and transport reimbursements, handling tax-related files, and managing ad hoc documentation such as employment and visa letters. The team also supports background checks for interns, contractors, and new hires, along with onboarding, probation management, and offboarding processes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking to speak to candidates who are based in Gurugram for our hybrid working model.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Position Expectations&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Individual Contributor as part of the HR Shared Services team in India&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will play a vital role in processing the backend transactions related to the General Employee Queries, Benefits, Payroll, Compensation and other crucial departments, along with making sure that the relevant SLA’s are met&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learn and perform newly transitioned processes and over time gain subject matter expertise in the respective departments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adhere to and demonstrate high proficiency in agreed critical metrics &amp;amp; SLAs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in building and maintaining the Standard Operating Procedures for Case Management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver high quality and consistent service delivery to all internal customers and partners and follow Standard Operating Procedures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively partners in the Data Management tasks like Audits, Reporting, Data Entry/Update etc&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Key Skills &amp;amp; Abilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience for 3+ years in HR Operations / Shared Services in an HR Shared Services role for Americas region&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has expertise in HR Operations with eye for detail and process adherence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Is a self-starter who is intrinsically motivated for their own performance to achieve desired results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can function independently, with minimal mentorship and supervision&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Open to work in a 24X7 role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Is agile and can function in an ambiguous environment, capable of taking charge when the situation needs it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Should be proficient with ticketing tools and should have been excellent in meeting HRSS performance parameters - case handling, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to get into detailing the process and have an eye for detail to suggest process improvements&lt;/li&gt;
