&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Qualifications/Requirements/We’re looking for someone with&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working enterprise and large Digital Native accounts, opening them from scratch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic mindset, experience selling toC-Level, focusing on key account initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
