nit":null,"max_value":"0.0","min_value":"0.0"},"value_type":"currency_range"},{"id":57694516,"name":"Job Post Range (Poland)","value":null,"value_type":"currency_range"},{"id":64002488,"name":"Job Post Range (Italy)","value":null,"value_type":"currency_range"}],"id":7311204,"updated_at":"2026-10-27T16:24:13-04:00","requisition_id":"425654","title":"Enterprise Sales Development Representative","company_name":"MongoDB","first_published":"2025-10-21T16:12:22-04:00","language":"en","application_deadline":null,"content":"&lt;p&gt;At MongoDB, our Account Development team works closely with our partners in both Sales and Marketing to build fanatical customer enthusiasm around MongoDB. SDR reps are responsible for identifying and qualifying new opportunities for our sales organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We view our Account Development program as the best way to turbocharge a long and successful career in sales and view our Sales Development Representatives (SDRs) as the next wave of Account Executives at MongoDB.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Being an SDR is often a first step to jump-starting a career in sales. At MongoDB, we have a culture that celebrates diversity, fosters growth and enablement, and ensures that we provide our SDRs with the tools and the confidence that they need to grow their careers. We invest heavily in the training and development of our team. You will always have the support from our sales enablement org and managers that will maintain 1:1 coaching throughout your career here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our SDRs gain an understanding of our product, community, who we sell to, why they care, and what makes us relevant. They learn how to generate a pipeline quickly and effectively as well as how to achieve a good discovery and qualification. The team is a crucial resource for sales teams across MongoDB to get great talent from. This helps us scale our teams, as well as ensure that we have a culture of meritocracy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking to speak to candidates who are based in Austin, TX for our hybrid working model.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Day to Day&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li4&quot;&gt;Identify high-potential businesses that would be a good fit to work with MongoDB across your region&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Work with the Sales team to develop and lead inbound and outbound campaigns from idea-generation through to qualified call&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Develop strong sales and product knowledge&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Interact with IT and business decision makers via telephone and email&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Update lead and prospect activity in Salesforce to ensure effective lead management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Set qualified introductory meetings for the Sales team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Nurture early phase opportunities for future pipeline potential&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Exceed monthly and quarterly opportunity quota&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Build strong relationships with our marketing team and Account Executives, where we pull together to maximize the win for our business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li5&quot;&gt;Invest in your self-development, focusing on the skills and attributes that will make you successful in your core role and get you set for future success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Bring to the Table&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li4&quot;&gt;A self-starter with a track record of hitting and exceeding goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Outstanding communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Time management skills and ability to work either independently or through coaching&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Desire to work in a fast-paced and high growth environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li5&quot;&gt;Passionate about cutting-edge technology with the aptitude to learn new and exciting IT software products, as well as, understand business critical solutions quickly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Things We Love&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li4&quot;&gt;Strong and progressive academic background&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Familiarity with database, web server, and open source technology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li5&quot;&gt;Working experience with Salesforce.com&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why You Should Apply&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li4&quot;&gt;Great Earning Potential&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li6&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Welcoming and inclusive workplace &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;Meet MongoDB’s Employee Affinity Groups!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Continuous career development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Sales training in MEDDIC and Command of the Message&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Benefits include:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Sales Bootcamp&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Internal mentor and buddy program cross-departmentally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About MongoDB&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;MongoDB is built for change, empowering our customers and our people to innovate at the speed of the market. We have redefined the data platform for the AI era, enabling builders to create, transform, and disrupt industries with software. MongoDB’s unified data platform, the most widely available, globally distributed data platform on the market, helps organizations modernize legacy workloads, embrace innovation, and unleash AI. Our cloud-native platform, MongoDB Atlas, is the only globally distributed, multi-cloud data platform and is available across AWS, Google Cloud, and Microsoft Azure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With offices worldwide and over 67,000 customers, including 75% of the Fortune 100 and AI-native startups, relying on MongoDB for their most important applications, we’re powering the next era of software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our compass at MongoDB is our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.mongodb.com/company&quot;&gt;Leadership Commitment,&lt;/a&gt; guiding how and why we make decisions, show up for each other, and win. It’s what makes us MongoDB.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To drive the personal growth and business impact of our employees, we’re committed to developing a supportive and enriching culture for everyone. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.mongodb.com/company/blog/culture/employee-benefits-that-make-a-difference-at-mongodb&quot;&gt;From employee affinity groups, to fertility assistance and a generous parental leave policy&lt;/a&gt;, we value our employees’ wellbeing and want to support them along every step of their professional and personal journeys.&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.mongodb.com/blog/channel/culture&quot;&gt; Learn more about what it’s like to work at MongoDB&lt;/a&gt;, and help us make an impact on the world!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;MongoDB is committed to providing any necessary accommodations for individuals with disabilities within our application and interview process. To request an accommodation due to a disability, please inform your recruiter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;MongoDB, Inc. provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local laws.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;REQ ID: 425654&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;MongoDB’s base salary range for this role is posted below. Compensation at the time of offer is unique to each candidate and based on a variety of factors such as skill set, experience, qualifications, and work location. Salary is one part of MongoDB’s total compensation and benefits package. Other benefits for eligible employees may include: equity, participation in the employee stock purchase program, flexible paid time off, 20 weeks fully-paid gender-neutral parental leave, fertility and adoption assistance, 401(k) plan, mental health counseling, access to transgender-inclusive health insurance coverage, and health benefits offerings. Please note, the base salary range listed below and the benefits in this paragraph are only applicable to U.S.-based candidates.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;MongoDB’s base salary range for this role in the U.S. is:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$50,003.20&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$50,003.20 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;","departments":[{"id":38867,"name":"Sales Development","child_ids":[],"parent_id":336792}],"offices":[{"id":3964,"name":"Austin","location":"Austin, TX, United States","child_ids":[],"parent_id":23657}],"ai_disclaimer":null,"include_ai_disclaimer":false,"ai_opt_out_request_url":null},{"absolute_url":"https://www.mongodb.com/careers/job/?gh_jid=8236841","data_compliance":[{"type":"gdpr","requires_consent":false,"requires_processing_consent":false,"requires_retention_consent":false,"retention_period":null,"demographic_data_consent_applies":true}],"internal_job_id":3564358,"location":{"name":"Mexico City"},"metadata":[{"id":22194060,"name":"Position ID","value":"10015985","value_type":"short_text"},{"id":24918,"name":"Department ID","value":"D43190-Americas Marketing","value_type":"single_select"},{"id":22194061,"name":"Team","value":"T10135-AMER Field Marketing","value_type":"single_select"},{"id":4914027,"name":"Region","value":"North America","value_type":"single_select"},{"id":4137836,"name":"Working Model Eligibility","value":["2-Flexible"],"value_type":"multi_select"},{"id":4914029,"name":"Job Level","value":"Professional - IC","value_type":"single_select"},{"id":24109,"name":"Employment Type","value":"Full-time","value_type":"single_select"},{"id":1073551,"name":"Job Type","value":"Standard","value_type":"single_select"},{"id":988684,"name":"JD Link","value":"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1tWosA25QMXjIJqAQW7crjs09FxiddP3yngbD4aoxyfU/edit?tab=t.0","value_type":"url"},{"id":5525802,"name":"Baseline Budgeted Salary","value":null,"value_type":"currency_range"},{"id":5525816,"name":"Other Large Market Budgeted Salary","value":null,"value_type":"currency_range"},{"id":13324394,"name":"Job Post Range (United States)","value":{"unit":"MXN","max_value":"0.0","min_value":"0.0"},"value_type":"currency_range"},{"id":40497768,"name":"Job Post Range (Canada)","value":{"unit":"MXN","max_value":"0.0","min_value":"0.0"},"value_type":"currency_range"},{"id":57694516,"name":"Job Post Range (Poland)","value":null,"value_type":"currency_range"},{"id":64002488,"name":"Job Post Range (Italy)","value":null,"value_type":"currency_range"}],"id":8236841,"updated_at":"2026-10-27T16:24:13-04:00","requisition_id":"3273564358","title":"Field Marketing Manager","company_name":"MongoDB","first_published":"2026-10-05T16:07:55-04:00","language":"en","application_deadline":null,"content":"&lt;p&gt;The Regional Marketing Manager is a key execution engine within MongoDB&#39;s newly created AMER Marketing Hub based in Mexico City. MongoDB is looking for a driven, analytical, and experienced&amp;nbsp;Regional Marketing Manager based in Mexico City to join our high-performing AMER Marketing organization. In this role, you will be responsible for driving account expansion, developer groundswell, pipeline generation and deal acceleration across North America (US/Canada) while scaling impactful virtual programs across the region.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working directly under the leadership of the LATAM Regional Marketing Lead, you will collaborate daily with AMER Regional Marketing Managers, ABM Leads, Developer Relations, and Marketing Operations. You will own, build, and execute integrated field marketing plans that encompass high-touch regional events (Developer Days, AI Builder Days, sponsorships, pipeline acceleration dinners) and scalable virtual initiatives (Skill Badge workshops and webinars).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Because this role directly owns field execution in US territories,&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;on-site presence is critical. You will spend 20–30% of your time traveling to US markets to lead event execution, partner with local sales teams, and engage directly with developers, architects, and C-level executives.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;1. Program Execution &amp;amp; Operations&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, own, and execute an integrated marketing plan for assigned territories in North America, aligning programs directly with regional sales goals and routes to revenue&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a trusted partner to Sales leadership and Account Executives, understanding territory needs, strategic account challenges, and key decision-making personas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the regional marketing budget for assigned programs, ensuring disciplined allocation, optimization, and strong ROI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support MongoDB flagship events, regional roadshows, third-party conferences, and executive dinners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;2. Scalable Virtual Programs &amp;amp; Developer Groundswell&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and scale high-volume, virtual engagement programs across NAMER, including hands-on Skill Badge workshops, technical webinars, and virtual enablement series&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build developer groundswell across assigned accounts, tracking and reporting on developers enabled and certified within the region&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with cross-functional teams (Developer Relations, Product Marketing, ABM, and Partner Marketing) to deliver cohesive end-to-end buyer and developer journeys&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;3. AI Adoption, Process Innovation &amp;amp; Workflow Automation&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate strong curiosity and a forward-thinking mindset in the AI Era, continuously exploring and adopting AI tools and technologies to optimize daily marketing operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify manual bottlenecks and implement AI-driven workflow automations to improve process efficiency and team output&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate with high autonomy, independence, and adaptability, maintaining the flexibility needed to navigate evolving GTM priorities, cross-border timezone alignment, and fast-paced regional requests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;4. Data, Analytics &amp;amp; Performance Tracking&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track, measure, and report on program performance, MQL generation, pipeline creation, deal velocity, and Net Annual Recurring Revenue (NARR) influence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilize Salesforce, Tableau, and marketing automation tools to deliver rigorous quarterly retrospectives and actionable insights to leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experiment with new campaign formats and iterate quickly based on data-guided insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver post-event performance recaps and highlight best practices that can be scaled across NAMER&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Qualifications&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Location: Must be based in or near Mexico City (CDMX)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;US Travel &amp;amp; Documentation: Ability and willingness to travel 20–30% of the time to North America (US/Canada). Must possess a valid Passport and a US Visa&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Language Proficiency: Exceptional written and verbal English fluency is required (daily interaction with US cross-functional teams)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3–6 years of B2B field marketing, regional marketing, or demand generation experience in enterprise SaaS, cloud, or technology companies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI &amp;amp; Automation Mindset: Practical experience or strong proficiency using AI tools to automate marketing workflows, streamline tasks, and increase operational output independently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adaptability &amp;amp; Independence: High degree of flexibility, proactive problem-solving skills, and the ability to work self-sufficiently across timezones and shifting priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record building and executing complex field marketing plans in direct alignment with Sales teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong proficiency with B2B marketing stacks (Salesforce, Wrike, Tableau, Jira, and event management platforms)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical and metrics-driven mindset with proven capability to prove ROI against marketing spend&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication, stakeholder management, and project leadership skills with a positive, can-do attitude&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with developer, architect, or IT decision-maker (ITDM) audiences and developer marketing programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What Success Looks Like in Year 1&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Seamless onboarding into the AMER Marketing Hub and immediate operational partnership with US regional leads&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High-quality, flaw-free execution of assigned Developer Days, AI Builder Days, and virtual Skill Badge workshops&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistent achievement of SLAs for campaign setup, lead upload, and post-event reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Positive feedback and strong trust built across Sales and Marketing counterparts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Position Details&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reports to: Regional Marketing Lead, LATAM&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Location: Mexico City (CDMX), Mexico&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel Requirement: 20–30% travel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Department: Marketing – Regional / Revenue Marketing AMER&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About MongoDB&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;MongoDB is built for change, empowering our customers and our people to innovate at the speed of the market. We have redefined the data platform for the AI era, enabling builders to create, transform, and disrupt industries with software. MongoDB’s unified data platform, the most widely available, globally distributed data platform on the market, helps organizations modernize legacy workloads, embrace innovation, and unleash AI. Our cloud-native platform, MongoDB Atlas, is the only globally distributed, multi-cloud data platform and is available across AWS, Google Cloud, and Microsoft Azure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With offices worldwide and over 67,000 customers, including AI-native startups and approximately 75% of the Fortune 100, relying on MongoDB for their most important applications, we’re powering the next era of software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our compass at MongoDB is our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.mongodb.com/company&quot;&gt;Leadership Commitment,&lt;/a&gt; guiding how and why we make decisions, show up for each other, and win. It’s what makes us MongoDB.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To drive the personal growth and business impact of our employees, we’re committed to developing a supportive and enriching culture for everyone. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.mongodb.com/company/blog/culture/employee-benefits-that-make-a-difference-at-mongodb&quot;&gt;From employee affinity groups, to fertility assistance and a generous parental leave policy&lt;/a&gt;, we value our employees’ wellbeing and want to support them along every step of their professional and personal journeys.&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.mongodb.com/blog/channel/culture&quot;&gt; Learn more about what it’s like to work at MongoDB&lt;/a&gt;, and help us make an impact on the world!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;MongoDB is committed to providing any necessary accommodations for individuals with disabilities within our application and interview process. To request an accommodation due to a disability, please inform your recruiter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;MongoDB is an equal opportunities employer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Req. ID: 3273564358&lt;/p&gt;
