&lt;p&gt;We are looking to speak to candidates who are based in Singapore for our hybrid working model.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively prospect, identify, qualify and develop a sales pipeline through our Cloud Partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with our Sales team to close business to meet and exceed monthly, quarterly and annual bookings objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own, on behalf of VP - Area Sales, all things cloud partner related&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage Cloud Service Partners, AWS, Microsoft and Google Cloud across ASEAN.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Global Pillar teams for backup and support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in our sales enablement trainings, including our comprehensive Sales Bootcamp, advanced sales training, and leadership development programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Educate and enable the internal sales organization on Cloud Service Providers (CSP) engagement processes and broader co-sell motions to accelerate deal cycles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and execute joint partner programs, marketing activities, and go-to-market initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruit and build strong, effective partner relationships, resulting in growth opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Requirements&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years field experience of quota-carrying experience in a fast-paced and competitive market with a focus on new business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of quota-carrying experience generating pipeline and selling through Cloud Partners, in a heavy sales matrix model&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to articulate the business value of complex enterprise technology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Possess aptitude to learn quickly and establish credibility. High EQ and self-aware&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passionate about growing your career in the largest market in software (database) and developing and maintaining an in-depth understanding of MongoDB products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Driven and competitive: Possess a strong desire to be successful&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skilled in building business champions and running a complex sales process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of overachievement and hitting sales targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to articulate the business value of complex enterprise technology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of overachievement and hitting sales targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous Sales Methodology training (e.g. MEDDIC, SPIN, Challenger Sales)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skilled in managing time and resources; sound approach to qualifying opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BA/BS required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A plus - Familiarity with databases, devops and open source technology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
