ing engagements ensure that our some of the most results-oriented and complex global organizations successfully deliver on their critical initiatives and get the best out of MongoDB.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Help us take our business to the next level of excellence in delivery and governance. You will have abundant opportunities to significantly impact the growth of MongoDB and collaborate with a team of technologists, sales and delivery professionals who are among the best in their fields.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role will be based remotely in Taiwan&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Position Expectations&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accountable for project planning and execution, customer experience, and ensuring MongoDB delivery meets committed scope and budget&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employ project management excellence to navigate with agility the complex organizations of large enterprises, building mindshare to plan and execute programs likely to have ambiguous risks and challenges&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain excellence of project governance with internal and customer stakeholders, managing day-to-day project planning and execution, project scope, expectations and risks, and ensuring timelines are met and quality results produced&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lend support to pre-sale engagements to assist with scoping of solution and project scope definition&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adopt and contribute to the continuous improvement of MongoDB&#39;s engagement and project delivery methodologies&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidently lead project meetings, owning meeting agenda and meeting outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the management of scope, change controls, customer expectations and timelines&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Measures of Success&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate directly with customers and other internal teams to lead and deliver high-quality, reference-able engagements&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Of paramount importance is predictability: of forecasts for resource needs and revenue; of internal &amp;amp; customer stakeholder management; of outcomes; of risk management; of customer expectations and experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate eye for business through robust control of the internal and external budget, project margin, resource utilization and billability across your entire project portfolio&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Candidate Profile&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;University degree or relevant work experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years proven experience with enterprise-scale software solutions, large scale software engineering or consulting services delivery experience preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated leadership skills within complex, transformative projects, with direct responsibility for leading project teams, delivering high quality results on schedule and within budget&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable creating plans and priorities for both project delivery and customer resources&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated belief in the power of stakeholder management and communications; track record of affecting change through stakeholder engagement&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding and effective interpersonal skills; strong verbal and written communication abilities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consulting and delivery experience serving banking and securities clients in Taiwan is preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Certification or deep experience with standard frameworks such as the PMI PMBOK, or Scrum methodologies would be beneficial&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
