&lt;p&gt;Proactive in flagging risk early rather than late&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Executive-Grade Communication &amp;amp; Escalation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Skilled at concise, action-forward, owner-forward communication with senior stakeholders&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Discipline to escalate through the right channel rather than airing issues in shared threads&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
