&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Customer Mindset &amp;amp; Discretion&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience handling sensitive information and NDA/MNPI-level confidentiality&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Empathetic, patient, and service-oriented under demanding schedules&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p&gt;General Fit&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Broad technical aptitude across all categories above&lt;/p&gt;
