&lt;h3&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and drive full-cycle recruiting for a range of technical roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand your business unit’s objectives and challenges and use that information to attract quality candidates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and execute sourcing strategies resulting in candidate pipelines that meet hiring goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong relationships with Hiring Managers and partner with them on everything from setting recruiting strategies to closing candidates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilize data-driven insights and recruiting metrics to track pipeline health and inform hiring decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work effectively with internal clients to ensure the selection process results in quality hires&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure candidates have a positive interview experience from the screening process through offer negotiation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;We’re looking for someone who&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has 4+ years of in-house technical recruiting experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has a subject-matter expertise in recruiting across a variety of technical areas such as back-end systems, cloud products and security&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has previous experience in sourcing, recruiting, and closing top technical talent in Gurgaon&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has Bachelor&#39;s degree and/or equivalent experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has data-driven mentality and uses data to shape their recruiting strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrives in a fast-paced, team-oriented environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has excellent verbal and written communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
