&lt;p&gt;We are an agile and small team looking for an experienced engineer to join us. We are looking for someone who is excited about operating systems, development tools, programming languages and low-level C++ libraries.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking to speak to candidates who are based in Dublin for our hybrid working model.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Candidate Profile&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience in Systems programming in C++ or other low-level programming languages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with building production-level code. Experience in C++ is required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passionate about delivering and deploying a product with cross-team stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid computer science fundamentals, with strong competencies in data structures, algorithms, and software design/architecture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for learning new things in the domains of software engineering, distributed systems, and performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid verbal and written communication skills and highly motivated to collaborate with colleagues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Position Expectations&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand and improve the current functionality of the MongoDB Server’s Programmability features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead medium sized projects related to the team’s charter&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with colleagues at all stages of project lifecycle (ideation, requirements gathering, design, execution, and delivery)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.mongodb.com/company/leadership-principles&quot;&gt;leadership principles&lt;/a&gt;, and exemplify them in your work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continue to learn and be curious in growing your career!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write production-ready code in C++&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write unit tests and integration tests in C++, Javascript, and Python to demonstrate application correctness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigate the performance characteristics of the server and write performance regression tests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interview candidates for software engineering positions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle customer escalations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with stakeholders and engineering teams across the company to jointly work on large initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Success Measures&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In the first month, you will have understood the high level architecture of MongoDB and fixed a few bugs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In three months, you will have contributed to the development of a project slated for the next major release of MongoDB, and diagnosed and fixed a few customer or testing-reported issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In six months, you will have taken on code review responsibilities and are involved in reviewing the design for new features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In twelve months, you will be leading the development of a new feature and helping to mentor new engineers on the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
