&lt;p&gt;This role is for someone who wants to own M&amp;amp;A execution end-to-end. You&#39;ll independently source, evaluate, and run a steady pipeline of deals, partnering with the Sr. Director and VP on our highest-stakes transactions. Once a deal signs an LOI, you become the day-to-day driver — the person Finance, Legal, HR, and the business count on to get it through close and integration.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll work closely with Product, Engineering, Finance, People, and other business stakeholders to help shape decisions about MongoDB&#39;s position in data infrastructure and AI. The role sits primarily in Corporate Development, with regular exposure to our Ventures platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has 4–8 years of experience in Corporate Development, Investment Banking, Private Equity, or Venture Capital&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has meaningful experience running deal workstreams and is ready to own transactions end-to-end with real autonomy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Is comfortable operating independently, while knowing when to bring in the Sr. Director, VP, or other senior leaders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrates strong judgment, particularly under time pressure and incomplete information&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Holds a high bar for analytical rigor, but knows when to move without perfect data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can engage credibly with technical leaders while maintaining a clear business perspective&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Is direct, low-ego, and accountable — focused on outcomes, not process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you will do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own Deals, End-to-End&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independently source, evaluate, and run your own pipeline of M&amp;amp;A and investment opportunities, from initial engagement through LOI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and pressure-test valuation, structure, and strategic rationale, partnering with the Sr. Director and VP on the most complex or highest-stakes calls&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Know when to move on your own judgment and when to escalate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Be the Function&#39;s Go-To Person from LOI Through Close&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Once a deal signs an LOI, step in as the primary driver across every Corp Dev workstream to close — including the Sr. Director and VP&#39;s most strategic transactions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run tight, focused diligence across technical, product, commercial, and financial dimensions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate structuring and cross-functional input so nothing stalls between LOI and closure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring structure and clarity to the ambiguity that shows up in the final stretch of a deal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the primary driver through LOI signing, partner with the Integration Team and cross-functional stakeholders on integration planning, then hand off cleanly to the Integration team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Convert Market Insight into Action&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the Ventures team to surface actionable opportunities from a strong, continuously refreshed pipeline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a precise understanding of the competitive and technological landscape&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Move quickly and flag high-conviction opportunities to the Sr. Director and VP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Operate Effectively with Senior Stakeholders&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner directly with Product and Engineering leaders on strategic fit and integration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Finance and Legal to structure and close transactions efficiently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate clearly and concisely with stakeholders across the business, including senior leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What Success Looks Like&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You independently own and close well-scoped transactions end-to-end&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Once a deal hits LOI, you’re the person the Sr. Director and cross-functional partners rely on to drive it to close&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MongoDB runs multiple live deals simultaneously without losing focus or rigor&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ve built the track record and judgment to take on progressively larger and more strategic transactions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The overall quality and effectiveness of the Corporate Development function increases materially&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Position Expectations&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Based in San Francisco, New York, or Austin&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reports to the Sr. Director of Corporate Development &amp;amp; Ventures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistent local office presence, with travel as required for transactions and relationship development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About MongoDB&lt;/h3&gt;
