closely with them to evaluate, plan, execute, and measure strategic business initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position requires an adaptable self-starter who is able to work comfortably and communicate clearly with stakeholders across the organization, progress tasks from start to finish, and enjoy working in a fast-paced, challenging environment. This will be primarily an in-office role, and we are looking for candidates who plan to be available in our New York City office for approximately three to four days per week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own company key revenue forecast models for new and existing products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help drive the annual planning process; prepare monthly and quarterly board and executive reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the investor relations function and corporate development initiatives, including any potential M&amp;amp;A&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct ad-hoc analyses and build financial models to inform teams on operating strategies, investment recommendations, and new business opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop cross-functional partnerships with Leadership across the company to review investment opportunities, growth levers, and align on resourcing models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, collaborate, and contribute to business case development of new strategic initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide strategic advice and direction to facilitate fast decision-making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Requirements&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1 to 3 years experience in investment banking, management consulting, or an analytical role at a data-driven technology company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Superior analytical, critical thinking, and quantitative skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to analyze data, draw conclusions, and develop actionable recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidence to forge strong relationships with business partners at all levels of the organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive for results and a sense of urgency with the capacity to multitask and prioritize&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organized with rigorous attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent oral and written communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Candidates must possess substantial experience with financial modeling and proficiency in Excel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with data acquisition tools (e.g., SQL) and large datasets is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
